PARKING PERMIT RENEWAL

All employee parking permits for the Westfield office expire on December 31. To {{5}} your permit for next year, complete the online form on the facilities page of the intranet before December 15. {{6}}

New permits will be mailed to your desk during the first week of January. Until you receive {{7}}, you may continue to display your current permit. {{8}}, vehicles without a valid permit after January 10 may be asked to leave the lot.
